Description: Facilitate data wrangling and ecosystem analysis with Atlantis
    model inputs and outputs. Provides an S7 class 'Atlantis' that represents
    an Atlantis model, functions to read and write Atlantis files, and methods
    to extract diet tables, food webs and time series from a model.
URL: https://github.com/inSileco/atlantio
